{\pard\sa80\b\fs24 3. AI agents and online services\par}
{\pard\sa160 Acuto can run AI coding agents made by other companies, such as Claude Code (Anthropic), Codex (OpenAI), GitHub Copilot (GitHub), Gemini and Google Antigravity (Google). Each agent is a separate program that you sign in to with your own account, and your use of it is governed by that provider's own terms and privacy policy. Code, files and prompts you give an agent are sent to its provider.\par}
